   "children": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/rewards-sign-up/\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Points-Exchange-Divvy-1.jpg\" alt=\"Highway 90 dispensary's point exchange program - transfer rewards from other dispensaries to use at highway 90 in marlton\"></a></p><p>Have rewards sitting at another dispensary? Don’t let them go to waste! At Highway 90, we’re making it easy to bring your loyalty rewards with you through our new <strong>Points Exchange Program</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Transfer Your Cannabis Rewards to Highway 90</strong></h2><p>Switching dispensaries doesn’t mean starting over. Simply show our team your current loyalty points balance from another dispensary, and we’ll match your points with a <strong>1:1 exchange</strong> so you can continue earning and saving at Highway 90.</p><p>Whether you’ve recently discovered Highway 90 or are ready to make us your new go-to dispensary in Marlton, NJ, we’re here to make the transition seamless.</p><h2><strong>How the Points Exchange Program Works</strong></h2><p>Getting started is simple:</p><ol><li>Visit Highway 90 and sign up for our loyalty program.</li><li>Show a team member your current points balance from another dispensary.</li><li>We’ll match your existing points with a 1:1 exchange.</li><li>Your exchanged points will be added to your Highway 90 loyalty account.</li></ol><p>Please note that exchanged points and new member bonus points may take up to <strong>24 hours</strong> to appear in your account. Once loaded, your rewards will be available to use on your following visit.</p><h2><strong>Why Join the Highway 90 Loyalty Program?</strong></h2><p>As a Highway 90 loyalty member, you’ll gain access to exclusive savings, special promotions, and rewards every time you shop. Our goal is to reward our customers while providing an exceptional dispensary experience.</p><p>If you’ve been thinking about making the switch, now is the perfect time. Bring your rewards with you and keep the savings going at Highway 90.</p><p>Visit Highway 90 at <strong>90 Old Marlton Pike, Marlton, NJ 08053</strong> and ask a team member about our Points Exchange Program today!</p><h3><strong>Shop Highway 90’s Cannabis Specials &amp; Savings:</strong></h3>",
     "from": "content"
    }
   ]
